 ## Background
-The method originates from parallel volume rendering implementations using MPI, where hierarchical reduction is used to aggregate partial results [S1, unofficial]. It is commonly used in scientific visualization and astrophysics simulations where large volumetric datasets are rendered in parallel [S2, unofficial]. The tree-based reduction of volumetric grids is described in the context of visualizing cosmological simulations [S2, unofficial].
